🟢 What is SARSA?

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📌 Definition

**SARSA** is an RL algorithm that updates Q-values using:

👉 Current policy

---

📊 Full Form

```text id="sarsa1"
State → Action → Reward → State → Action
```

---

📊 SARSA Update Rule

[
Q(s,a) = Q(s,a) + \alpha [R + γ Q(s',a') - Q(s,a)]
]

---

🧠 Key Difference

* Q-Learning → Uses **best possible action**
* SARSA → Uses **actual action taken**

---

⚖️ Q-Learning vs SARSA

---

# 📊 Comparison Table

| Feature  | Q-Learning | SARSA     |
| -------- | ---------- | --------- |
| Type     | Off-policy | On-policy |
| Update   | Max Q      | Actual Q  |
| Behavior | Greedy     | Safe      |
| Risk     | Higher     | Lower     |

---

🧠 Intuition

```text id="q3"
Q-Learning → "What is best possible?"
SARSA → "What did I actually do?"
```

