⚙️ Simple PyTorch DQN Example

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```python id="dqn_code"
import torch
import torch.nn as nn

class DQN(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.fc = nn.Sequential(
            nn.Linear(4, 64),
            nn.ReLU(),
            nn.Linear(64, 2)
        )

    def forward(self, x):
        return self.fc(x)
```

